{"id": "69156", "title": "恶弟的禁宠", "author": "沙微日记", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69156.htm", "intro": "他叫顾宠宠，据说是B城最香艳浪荡的禽兽一只。\r\n十八岁他成人礼晚上，拉过她白皙的手，猝不及防，将它狠狠的按在他的西装裤上，他笑得浪荡下流，却又无辜纯真，“‘姐姐’，弟弟可实在是想你的……紧…”\r\n她给了他一巴掌，他笑得那叫一个纯净如白莲，可眸光却下流无耻，将她狠狠的按在墙上……\r\n他就是知道她不会叫，也不敢叫，谁叫她是从小到大最疼他的“姐姐”。\r\n\r\n有人说，万恶不作顾宠宠最疼爱的人是他的“姐姐”梁城城，可也有人说，梁城城也不过是下流的顾宠宠最香艳的一只玩具，他让她向东，她不会向西。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69156", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10560043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10560044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10560045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10560046.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10560047.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6", "file": "10560048.html", "available": true}, {"title": "7", "file": "10560049.html", "available": true}, {"title": "8", "file": "10560050.html", "available": true}, {"title": "9", "file": "10560051.html", "available": true}, {"title": "10", "file": "10560052.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11", "file": "10560053.html", "available": true}, {"title": "12", "file": "10560054.html", "available": true}, {"title": "13", "file": "10560055.html", "available": true}, {"title": "14", "file": "10560056.html", "available": true}, {"title": "15", "file": "10560057.html", "available": true}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10560058.html", "available": true}]}